            }
          },
          "@id": "interactions_test/timestamp"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rai:dataCollection": "Movie profiles were generated by Claude Haiku 4.5 (Anthropic) using genome tags from MovieLens 20M and metadata from TMDb API. No user data was collected or generated. Interaction data comes from the existing MovieLens 20M dataset.",
  "rai:dataCollectionTimeframe": "Profile generation: April 2026. TMDb metadata crawled: March 2026. MovieLens 20M interactions: 1995-2015 (original dataset).",
  "rai:personalSensitiveInformation": "None. The dataset contains only item-side features (movie profiles). User interaction data is from the pre-existing MovieLens 20M dataset.",
  "rai:dataBiases": "LLM-generated profiles may reflect biases in Claude Haiku 4.5's training data, potentially affecting representation of certain genres, cultures, or film traditions. English-only coverage limits applicability to non-English film markets.",
  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "citation": "Anonymous (2026). LLM-MovieLens: A Density-Paradigm Framework with Class-Level Triangulation for LLM-Augmented Collaborative Filtering. CIKM Full Research Track.",
  "citeAs": "Anonymous (2026). LLM-MovieLens: A Density-Paradigm Framework with Class-Level Triangulation for LLM-Augmented Collaborative Filtering. CIKM Full Research Track."
